<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts tender for 25,000 tonnes of barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts tender for 25,000 tonnes of barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus on Tuesday accepted the tender of Crissel Greece for the supply of 25,000 tonnes of feed barley at $136.49 per tonne, the island's grain commission said.</p>
<p>Prices include C &amp; F.</p>
<p>Shipment is scheduled for December or January.</p>
</text>
